e/1232211.mari", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hainohito1111/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/88062d24/uploads/origins/9813f2e8-6bbd-4575-a12d-45057bd4440f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4b0f5a9effa54ef63dd505c84f29753", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88062d24/uploads/origins/9813f2e8-6bbd-4575-a12d-45057bd4440f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4b0f5a9effa54ef63dd505c84f29753, https://si.imgix.net/88062d24/uploads/origins/9813f2e8-6bbd-4575-a12d-45057bd4440f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce1c8a766d92b2cdb2bbce3fc01ed6cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88062d24/uploads/origins/9813f2e8-6bbd-4575-a12d-45057bd4440f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60716ff0bcf9272d89e73dc248e446ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nTwitterで猫又と猫ちゃんの絵を拝見して、とてもかわいいと思いました！\nぜひ、私の猫又を描いてほしいです。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@katae_666/works/2", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}